chatgpt-docstrings.promptPattern:
Generate a {docstring_style}-style docstring for the following Python {entity} code.
Begin with exactly one one-line summary. Do not add any extra description before Parameters. Use section headers Parameters, Returns, Raises, and Notes with NumPy underlines. Wrap all lines at 72 characters. In Parameters, include only if arguments exist and format as name : type_hint followed by a short description. In Returns, omit if return type is None, otherwise format as type_hint followed by a short description. In Raises, include only if relevant and list each exception with a short description. In Notes, add only important non-obvious info as bullet points, using '-' and not bullets, with concrete examples if needed.
{code}
